canvas 500 270
label "System overview: a folder of Markdown items and one configuration file goes through a deterministic build that emits pages for people, a graph, llms.txt with chunks, and the discovery document, which is highlighted"
caption "The highlighted discovery document is where an agent starts; people start at the pages. Both come from the same files."
region out 312 14 172 226 "what the build emits"
box pages 324 28 148 36 "pages for people"
box graph 324 76 148 36 "graph: JSON-LD, RDF"
box llms 324 124 148 36 "llms.txt, chunks"
box disc 324 172 148 36 "discovery document" acc
box files 16 100 120 60 "Markdown items|+ one config file"
box build 176 100 104 60 "deterministic|build"
arrow files build
arrow build pages
arrow build graph
arrow build llms
arrow build disc
note "one folder in, every surface out — the same bytes on every machine"
